NC Digital builds fast, modern, SEO-focused websites for small businesses across East Wales — from Mold and Flint to Ruthin, Buckley, and the wider Flintshire and Denbighshire area. We build every site from scratch, designed to generate enquiries.

> "A well-built website is your digital shopfront — it should be fast, clear, and designed to convert visitors into customers."

## Web design built for East Wales businesses

Customers across East Wales search online before they make contact. If your business isn't showing up in local search results, a competitor is picking up that work instead.

We build websites with local search built in, combining strong service pages, location signals, and technical SEO so East Wales businesses get found. Pair your new site with our [East Wales SEO service](/seo-east-wales/) to drive consistent Google traffic.

## What's included

- Custom website optimised for speed, clarity, and conversions
- Mobile-first design tested across all devices
- On-page SEO targeting your area and surrounding regions
- Secure UK-based [hosting with SSL](/services/website-hosting-security/) and performance optimisation
- Full content management access — no locked templates
- Google Analytics setup
- Training so you can manage your own site

## Areas we serve across East Wales

[Mold](/web-design-mold/), [Flint](/web-design-flint/), [Buckley](/web-design-buckley/), [Holywell](/web-design-holywell/), [Ruthin](/web-design-ruthin/), [Denbigh](/web-design-denbigh/), and across East Wales. We also cover [South Wales](/web-design-south-wales/), [North Wales](/web-design-north-wales/), and [Mid Wales](/web-design-mid-wales/).

